### Optional: `loopgoal.config.json` (Custom Project Override)

If a developer is working in a custom monorepo (Turborepo, Poetry, Cargo workspace), they can place this in their root directory to tell LoopGoal exactly what commands to watch:

```json
{
  "commands": [
    {
      "name": "typecheck",
      "watch": ["src/**/*.ts", "src/**/*.tsx"],
      "run": "npx tsc --noEmit --pretty false"
    },
    {
      "name": "unit-tests",
      "watch": ["src/**/*.ts", "tests/**/*.ts"],
      "run": "npx vitest run --bail=1"
    }
  ]
}

```

