### What the AI Agent Reads: `.loopgoal/livefeed.json`

Because the daemon runs in the background, the agent never waits on slow test suites. It reads this instantly ($<2\text{ ms}$ disk read):

```json
{
  "heartbeat": 14,
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-22T01:05:12.418Z",
  "latencyMs": "142ms",
  "status": "failing",
  "stats": {
    "totalErrors": 1,
    "runtimes": ["typescript", "python"]
  },
  "errors": [
    {
      "source": "tsc",
      "file": "src/controllers/auth.ts",
      "line": 48,
      "col": 12,
      "code": "TS2339",
      "message": "Property 'organizationId' does not exist on type 'SessionUser'."
    }
  ],
  "canCommit": false,
  "verificationToken": null
}

```

