### How to Run It in Any Project

Add it to `package.json` scripts:

```bash
# Terminal 1: Developer or Agent starts the watcher
node loopgoal-daemon.mjs

# Or detached in the background:
nohup node loopgoal-daemon.mjs > /dev/null 2>&1 &

```

The agent simply monitors `.loopgoal/livefeed.json`. The moment `canCommit === true`, it receives the cryptographic `verificationToken` and proceeds to commit.